<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mumtaz Mahal returns at 21 weeks 2 days, four weeks after her first intravenous iron dose, which she tolerated without reaction. She has more energy and is less breathless. It is the month of Ramadan; she has chosen not to fast during the pregnancy, as her faith allows, and plans to make up the days later. She feels the baby move every day. She takes aspirin and folic acid. She has no headache, visual change, abdominal pain, contractions, bleeding, or urinary symptoms. She had the anatomy scan this morning. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Iron</td><td>First intravenous dose four weeks ago, no reaction; more energy</td></tr><tr><td>Fasting</td><td>Not fasting this Ramadan, by her own choice</td></tr><tr><td>Fetal movement</td><td>Daily</td></tr><tr><td>Scan</td><td>Anatomy scan this morning</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

